// Unknown number, not in Contacts. A minute into the case it takes over the phone and writes first.
// Shows the screen effects: #effect: <name> plays one when the line arrives (names in com/rukia/phone/Effects.kt).

=== hacker ===
Hello. #delay: 60 #effect: hacked
Sorry for the intrusion. Your phone was easier to open than I expected.
I've read your chats. All of them. #delay: 4
* [Who are you?]
    Someone who knows what happened in the lab. #delay: 3
* [Get out of my phone.]
    Rude. #delay: 2 #effect: glitch
    I'm helping you, you know. #delay: 3
- There was a van behind the lab that night. Someone posted it on Gonpi. #delay: 4
Look at who told them to delete it. #delay: 3
I have to go. They're watching me too. #delay: 5 #effect: blackout
-> DONE
